{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick a spot, drop a pixel, and see what happens.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/eeadcc037085624383c9d08b927c68f2.avif?t=1758568368\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thousands of people are painting on the same grid, shaping and reshaping it in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every mark counts, whether it\u2019s part of a huge mural or just a single dot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/465711a34d409a4936d2d84bf3545b9e.avif?t=1758568368\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc40 Watch the canvas change live as others draw alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u23f3 Place a pixel, wait for your timer, then go again - planning matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udd1d Join friends or public groups to defend your space or build something bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2694\ufe0f Fight for territory, collaborate on art, or quietly slip in your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/2aefcfc0f3dbf316ac949ead09bb41df.avif?t=1758568368\" width=616 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The grid is open. Will you create, defend, or destroy?</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Strokes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946790/9ad8a4209e35e54cc4d5fd061e6aad4a338ee844.jpg"},{"name":"Brush Control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946790/a12fd7f7da83437ef7f94758a3ad75bc2d2e2359.jpg"},{"name":"Canvas Filler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946790/c352668d3cf708b2e9d4d324f57b70f1e8ef1962.jpg"},{"name":"Pixel Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946790/9ed93ddfacbad026454c2ca68b55217790e42d4c.jpg"},{"name":"Clean Slate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946790/5bec7c16fbc2e477e0b1b3ca4bcb17930fcc7379.jpg"},{"name":"Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946790/f8c7e485dc61d8763b3f74d468d42a6844791701.jpg"},{"name":"Layered Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946790/5c6817258f8053302faf9864882820631ffa31f7.jpg"},{"name":"Cracked One Open","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946790/c115210b02049a9f724b2fd4043531a0d9eeed35.jpg"},{"name":"Egg Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946790/7cc46235030ace711c7b8a398f6f0ec764bfcc7d.jpg"},{"name":"Egg Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946790/a165910506e5d5a120a5c669019f0c0ac2c6c35e.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946790?t=1758568368","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste